<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HNC Software raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HNC Software raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney raised its rating for HNC Software Inc on Tuesday to buy from neutral, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company rose 1-1/8to 19-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
